    <h3>CAVA NO.01</h3>
    <p class="meta">Eau de Parfum &nbsp;/&nbsp; 50 ML</p>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:1rem">Bergamot, iris, dan amber dalam komposisi yang tenang namun berkarakter.</p>
    <span class="btn btn-ghost" style="margin-top:1.6rem">View details <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></span>
  </div>
</article>
<article class="card reveal" data-delay="90" data-cursor="VIEW" tabindex="0" role="button"
  data-name="CAVA NO.02" data-desc="Kesegaran aquatic yang bersih dengan jejak kayu yang hangat." data-top="Sea Salt|Lemon" data-heart="Neroli|Violet" data-base="Vetiver|White Musk" data-img="/images/cava-editorial-01.jpg">
  <div class="ph"><img decoding="async" src="/images/cava-editorial-01.jpg" alt="CAVA NO.02 eau de parfum" loading="lazy"></div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3>CAVA NO.02</h3>
    <p class="meta">Eau de Parfum &nbsp;/&nbsp; 50 ML</p>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:1rem">Kesegaran aquatic yang bersih dengan jejak kayu yang hangat.</p>
    <span class="btn btn-ghost" style="margin-top:1.6rem">View details <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></span>
  </div>
</article>
<article class="card reveal" data-delay="180" data-cursor="VIEW" tabindex="0" role="button"
  data-name="CAVA NO.03" data-desc="Oriental lembut dengan vanila, tonka, dan resin yang dalam." data-top="Cardamom|Mandarin" data-heart="Rose|Saffron" data-base="Vanilla|Tonka|Benzoin" data-img="/media/cava-duo.jpg">
  <div class="ph"><img decoding="async" src="/media/cava-duo.jpg" alt="CAVA NO.03 eau de parfum" loading="lazy"></div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3>CAVA NO.03</h3>
    <p class="meta">Eau de Parfum &nbsp;/&nbsp; 50 ML</p>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:1rem">Oriental lembut dengan vanila, tonka, dan resin yang dalam.</p>
    <span class="btn btn-ghost" style="margin-top:1.6rem">View details <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></span>
  </div>
</article>
<article class="card reveal" data-delay="270" data-cursor="VIEW" tabindex="0" role="button"
  data-name="CAVA NO.04" data-desc="Floral putih yang halus, elegan, dan terasa dekat di kulit." data-top="Pear|Bergamot" data-heart="Tuberose|Peony" data-base="Sandalwood|Musk" data-img="/images/cava-editorial-02.jpg">
  <div class="ph"><img decoding="async" src="/images/cava-editorial-02.jpg" alt="CAVA NO.04 eau de parfum" loading="lazy"></div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3>CAVA NO.04</h3>
